{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"catastrophic-forgetting","content_sha256":"sha256:c473205d969b988c76e6393b224dc06626544b09791fbe3f36ef6cb9449e4509","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789966795.145303,"domain":"llm-training","explanation":"缓解遗忘靠:数据重放混通用数据、PEFT(LoRA)冻结基座、小学习率+早停+正则。反例是用超大 lr 长时间猛训窄数据,只会加剧遗忘,是错误做法。","id":"q-train-iq-catastrophic-forgetting","options":[{"id":"a","text":"把学习率调到远大于预训练、并训练更多轮，让模型彻底记住新领域"},{"id":"b","text":"混入一定比例通用/预训练数据做重放(replay)"},{"id":"c","text":"用 LoRA 等 PEFT 冻结基座、只训练少量增量参数"},{"id":"d","text":"使用更小的学习率并控制训练步数/加正则"}],"prompt":"在窄领域数据上全参数微调后，模型通用能力明显下降(灾难性遗忘)，常见缓解手段不包括下面哪一项?","review_state":null,"rubric":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"judgment","source_refs":[{"kind":"public_interview_topic","title":"LLMs 相关知识及面试题(llm_interview_note)","url":"https://github.com/wdndev/llm_interview_note"},{"kind":"public_interview_topic","title":"LLMs 千面郎君(LLMs_interview_notes)","url":"https://github.com/km1994/LLMs_interview_notes"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"finetuning","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
